                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 134.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Davis to Mr.
                        Bancroft.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi><hi
                                rendition="#italic"> Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 14, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>News of credit sent to Washburne. Gramont gave notice two weeks since of probable
                    expulsion. Washburne protested at length.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
